     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<div><br></div><div>Tomorrow we will <b>not be hosting our usual weekly workgroup</b>, but instead will be co-hosting a presentation/short workshop with #maptimedavis. In order to attend, you will have to register for the workshop (free of charge). This should be an excellent presentation by D-RUG&#39;s own Christian John. Please see details and link to register below. </div><div><br></div><div>Remember, if you have any questions you can always post them on our discourse website: <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465301336000&amp;usg=AOvVaw22tUuBO_1P7oHsCiki8E4y\">https://d-rug.discourse.group/</a>. We would love to hear from you! </div><div><br></div><div>===========================================================================<br clear=\"all\"><div><h1 style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:24pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;margin-bottom:9pt;line-height:33pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:21pt;color:rgb(2,40,81);text-transform:uppercase\">#MAPTIMEDAVIS &amp; DAVIS R USERS GROUP WORKSHOP: EARTH ENGINE &amp; R FOR PRESENTATION-QUALITY CONTEXTUAL MAPS<u></u><u></u></span></h1><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Description: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">We will combine the power of Earth Engine with the user-friendliness of R to generate beautiful, presentation-quality contextual maps. The workshop will focus on Landsat imagery, but is generalizable to other remote sensing products. Creativity is encouraged! We will use Earth Engine to access, filter, and crop data for download, and then use R to wrangle our dataset and generate beautiful, high-resolution plots.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Location: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Online via Zoom. Please register for the link to participate.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Registration: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><a href=\"https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/MaptimeDavisWorkshopEarth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/MaptimeDavisWorkshopEarth/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465301336000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ARANdxECc5fUbcKEcPpXy\"><span style=\"color:rgb(93,167,186);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Register Here</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Cost: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Free of charge<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Learning Objectives: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Attendees will learn how to access, filter, and download data using Google Earth Engine, and to process and plot raster datasets using a tidyverse approach in R.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Prerequisites: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">No experience necessary, but Earth Engine and R exposure are a bonus!<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Software: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Attendees will need to have a Google Earth Engine account prior to attending the workshop (may take a few days to process a request for a new account), and have R installed. Attendees will also need to have the following R packages installed: tidyverse, raster, sf, rgdal, RStoolbox.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Presenter: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Christian John<br><br></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u><u></u></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Presenter Bio: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Christian is a 4th-year PhD student in the Graduate Group in Ecology using novel remote sensing data to explore how snowmelt and plant growth drive bighorn sheep migration.</span></p></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">Martha Zillig (Wohlfeil)<div><br></div><div>PhD Candidate</div><div>Avian Ecology Lab, UC Davis</div><div>Wickson Hall 3017 </div><div><a href=\"http://marthazillig.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://marthazillig.github.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465301336000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jhFzdSNyhaSpjhS2ceUpv\">marthazillig.github.io</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
